# BuildKit Dockerfile-specific ignore (applies only to services/turnaround-iq/Dockerfile).
# Keeps host state (dev node_modules, VCS, docs, secrets) out of the context and
# out of the image layers — server-side .env files must never enter a build.
.git
.github
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/.env
**/.env.*
docs
infra
